WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.268 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, whoa.
Thank you so much.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:05.505 align:start size:94% position:6%
I moved here a couple of years
ago from Ireland,

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.908 size:81% position:41%
and I love your Irish
restaurants over here.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're so authentic,
you know?

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.745 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:15.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm a big fan of
the quesadillas.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:16.216 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:20.420 size:78% position:39%
Really just remind me
of home, you know?

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:23.256 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was in one of these
restaurants not so long ago.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:25.125 line:92%
I saw this on the menu --

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.761 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"Irish Nachos."

00:00:27.761 --> 00:00:29.095 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:30.930 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Fantastic.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:32.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
While I'm at it,
why don't I try

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
some of that famous
Canadian Sushi.

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's the thing --
I like Irish food.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:39.272 size:75% position:38% line:92%
I like Mexican food.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:43.243
Just advertise the place so
I know what to expect, you know?

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, "Do you like stew
and fajitas?

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:51.518 size:78% position:39%
Well, come on down to
Tac O'Flannigan's."

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:52.585 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:56.122 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Free tequila shot
with your Shepherd's Pie."

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.524 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.524 --> 00:00:59.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
I used to work at a bar
in Manhattan.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:02.629
And one time, I was serving
this guy, and he said to me,

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:08.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Uh, what's the least amount
of wings I can get?"

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.370 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Uh...none.

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:12.972 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.642 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You want me to ring that up
for you, or...?"

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:18.144 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.144 --> 00:01:19.946 line:92%
I do comedy full-time, now.

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:20.680 size:81% position:41% line:92%
I travel around a lot,

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:24.984
and I've noticed some people
over here feel very comfortable

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:28.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
complaining to me
about immigration

00:01:28.755 --> 00:01:32.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
like I'm not also
an immigrant.

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.428 align:start size:94% position:6%
Can you imagine
how crazy I'd sound

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.430 size:81% position:41% line:92%
if I agreed with them?

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I was just like,
"You know what? You're right.

00:01:40.733 --> 00:01:48.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm tired of these people
coming over here...

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:50.310 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
like I did."

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:51.144 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
"They're trying
to take the jobs...

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:57.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I'm also
trying to take."

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.619 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:02.522 line:92%
"They never pay taxes....

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:05.225 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm assuming,
'cause neither do I."

00:02:05.225 --> 00:02:06.326 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:10.697
"And the worst part about it,
they're coming from countries

00:02:10.697 --> 00:02:16.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
with a history of
terrorist organizations...

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.238 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:21.674 size:81% position:41% line:92%
...just like the IRA."

00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:23.343 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:25.044 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, thank you.

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've been traveling around
a lot, as I said.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I love your airlines
over here,

00:02:29.983 --> 00:02:32.585 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause they're
all horrific.

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:33.620 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.022
It's like they had a meeting
one day where they were like,

00:02:36.022 --> 00:02:37.657 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know,
if we're all terrible,

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:40.627 align:start size:94% position:6%
they have to fly
with one of us."

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:41.361 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.629 align:start size:94% position:6%
And in that meeting,
they were like,

00:02:42.629 --> 00:02:47.333
"Hey, United, you've been doing
awful well lately.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:51.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maybe take it back
a notch."

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:52.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
United was like
"On it,"

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:55.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just started
tazing passengers

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:57.977 size:88% position:44% line:92%
right, left, and center.

00:02:57.977 --> 00:02:59.012 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.247 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, thank you.

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then, they moved on
to the next airline, like,

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.618 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, guys,
we warned you."

00:03:05.618 --> 00:03:07.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they were like
"Roger that,"

00:03:07.253 --> 00:03:11.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
and just started drop-kicking
puppies off flights.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:13.259 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, they were like,
"Hey, Spirit...

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:18.264 size:84% position:42% line:92%
keep up the good work."

00:03:18.264 --> 00:03:19.265 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:23.369 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:23.369 --> 00:03:27.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause they are the mafia
of the sky.

00:03:27.006 --> 00:03:27.941 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:29.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Last time I flew
with Spirit,

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:32.912
I showed up to the airport on
a Monday, and they were like,

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:35.014 line:92%
"Eh, how about Thursday."

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.282 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause they're the ones
who invented

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:40.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
this low-fares over here,
where they were like,

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:44.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
"How would you like
to save $40

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:48.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the low, low cost
of you dignity?"

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:50.863 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause they have all these
crazy stipulations.

00:03:50.863 --> 00:03:56.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're like, "You don't get
a carry-on, no snacks.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.337 line:92%
Upon boarding the flight,

00:03:57.337 --> 00:04:00.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
the pilot gets to
punch you in the nuts....

00:04:00.974 --> 00:04:02.308 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:02.308 --> 00:04:05.511 align:start size:94% position:6%
...and call you father
a coward."

00:04:05.511 --> 00:04:06.579 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:09.182 size:78% position:39%
"Oh, and in the event
that we need to pull

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:10.683 size:78% position:39% line:92%
the evacuation slide,

00:04:10.683 --> 00:04:16.456 size:88% position:44%
a first-class passenger
gets to sit on your back

00:04:16.456 --> 00:04:20.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
as they ride you to safety
like a toboggan."

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:22.595 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:23.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
And every time,
I'm just like,

00:04:23.963 --> 00:04:26.466 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Well, if it'll
save me $40."

00:04:26.466 --> 00:04:30.103 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:31.904 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.373 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Thank you.

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:37.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
Although, clearly,
I'm exaggerating, there, guys,

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:42.215
you know, because Spirit
doesn't have first class.

00:04:42.215 --> 00:04:43.349 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.349 --> 00:04:45.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
First class on Spirit
is just the seats

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:49.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
where the oxygen masks
actually come down.

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:49.856 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:52.625 align:start size:94% position:6%
But right before they do,
a credit-card machine

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:54.661 line:92%
just descends from above,

00:04:54.661 --> 00:04:58.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
like, "How much do you
want your air?"

00:04:58.064 --> 00:04:58.865 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:58.865 --> 00:05:00.133 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right, that is the end
of my time.

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.768 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thank you so much.
I appreciate it.

00:05:01.768 --> 00:05:05.371 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:08.808 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Sean Finnerty.

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:10.076 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:15.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For more, go to
seanfinnertycomedy.com.

